#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:420
msgid "If enabled, formula for <b>Qty to Order</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, formel for <b>Antall som skal bestilles</b>: <br>\n"
"Nødvendig antall (Stykkliste) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Forventet antall</a>. <br> Dette bidrar til å unngå overbestilling."

#. Description of the 'Consider Projected Qty in Calculation (RM)' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:238
msgid "If enabled, formula for <b>Required Qty</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, formel for <b>Nødvendig antall</b>: <br>\n"
"Nødvendig antall (Stykkliste) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Forventet antall</a>. <br> Dette bidrar til å unngå overbestilling."

#. Description of the 'Create Ledger Entries for Change Amount' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'POS Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_settings/pos_settings.json:46
msgid "If enabled, ledger entries will be posted for change amount in POS transactions"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil posteringer bli bokført for vekslepenger i POS-transaksjoner."

#. Description of the 'Automatically run rules on unreconciled transactions'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:747
msgid "If enabled, rule matching algorithm will run every hour"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil regelmatchingsalgoritmen kjøres hver time."

#. Description of the 'Grant Commission' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json:914
msgid "If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and Sales Partner commission calculations"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil salg fra denne artikkelen inkluderes i provisjonsberegningene for selger og salgspartner"

#. Description of the 'Allow delivery of overproduced quantity' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:275
msgid "If enabled, system will allow user to deliver the entire quantity of the finished goods produced against the Subcontracting Inward Order. If disabled, system will allow delivery of only the ordered quantity."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet tillate brukeren å levere hele mengden ferdigvarer produsert mot Inngående underleveranseordre. Hvis deaktivert, vil systemet kun tillate levering av den bestilte mengden."

#. Description of the 'Set incoming rate as zero for expired Batch' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:314
msgid "If enabled, system will set incoming rate as zero for stand-alone credit notes with expired batch item."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, setter systemet inngående sats til null for frittstående kreditnotaer med utløpt partivare."

#. Description of the 'Deliver secondary Items' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:340
msgid "If enabled, the Secondary Items generated against a Finished Good will also be added in the Stock Entry when delivering that Finished Good."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil sekundærvarer generert mot en ferdigvare også bli lagt til i lagerbevegelsen når den ferdigvaren leveres."

#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'POS
#. Profile'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_profile/pos_profile.json:397
msgid "If enabled, the consolidated invoices will have rounded total disabled"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil konsoliderte fakturaer ha avrundet totalsum deaktivert"

#. Description of the 'Allow internal transfers at user-defined rate' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:428
msgid "If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. This will allow the user to specify a different rate for printing or taxation purposes."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil artikkelprisen ikke justeres til verdivurderingssatsen ved interne overføringer, men regnskapet vil fortsatt bruke verdivurderingssatsen. Dette lar brukeren angi en annen pris til utskrifts- eller skattemessige formål."

#. Description of the 'Validate Material Transfer warehouses' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:502
msgid "If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, må kilde- og mållageret i lagerbevegelsen for materialoverføring være forskjellige, ellers vil det oppstå en feil. Hvis lagerdimensjoner finnes, kan samme kilde- og mållager tillates, men minst ett av lagerdimensjonsfeltene må være forskjellig."

#. Description of the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:509
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. But, this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when it is caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative stock in all other cases."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet tillate negative lagerbeholdningsoppføringer for partiet. Dette kan imidlertid føre til feil verdivurderingssatser, så det anbefales å unngå å bruke dette alternativet. Systemet tillater negativ beholdning kun når den er forårsaket av tilbakedaterte oppføringer, og vil validere og blokkere negativ beholdning i alle andre tilfeller."

#. Description of the 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Batch'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/batch/batch.json:210
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock Settings. This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, tillater systemet negative beholdningsposteringer for dette partiet og overstyrer innstillingen «Tillat negativ beholdning for parti» i lagerinnstillingene. Dette kan føre til feil verdivurderingssatser, så det anbefales å unngå å bruke dette alternativet."

#. Description of the 'Allow UOM with conversion rate defined in Item' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:475
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow selecting UOMs in sales and purchase transactions only if the conversion rate is set in the item master."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet kun tillate valg av enheter i salgs- og innkjøpstransaksjoner dersom omregningskurs er angitt i artikkelregisteret."

#. Description of the 'Allow Editing of Items and Quantities in Work Order'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Manufacturing Settings'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.json:231
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow users to edit the raw materials and their quantities in the Work Order. The system will not reset the quantities as per the BOM, if the user has changed them."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet tillate brukere å redigere råvarene og mengdene deres i arbeidsordren. Systemet vil ikke tilbakestille mengdene i henhold til stykklisten hvis brukeren har endret dem."

#. Description of the 'Set valuation rate for rejected Materials' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json:250
msgid "If enabled, the system will generate an accounting entry for materials rejected in the Purchase Receipt."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet generere en regnskapspostering for materialer som er avvist i Varemottak."

#. Description of the 'Enable Item-wise Inventory Account' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json:994
msgid "If enabled, the system will use the inventory account set in the Item Master or Item Group or Brand. Otherwise, it will use the inventory account set in the Warehouse."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet bruke lagerkontoen som er angitt i Artikkelregisteret, Artikkelgruppen eller Merkevaren. Ellers vil det bruke lagerkontoen som er angitt i Lageret."

#. Description of the 'Do not use Batch-wise Valuation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:435
msgid "If enabled, the system will use the moving average valuation method to calculate the valuation rate for the batched items and will not consider the individual batch-wise incoming rate."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet bruke metoden glidende gjennomsnitt for verdivurdering til å beregne verdivurderingssatsen for partivarene og vil ikke ta hensyn til den individuelle inngående satsen per parti."

#. Description of the 'Validate Applied Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json:528
msgid "If enabled, then system will only validate the pricing rule and not apply automatically. User has to manually set the discount percentage / margin / free items to validate the pricing rule"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil systemet kun validere prisregelen og ikke bruke den automatisk. Brukeren må manuelt angi rabattprosenten / margen / gratisvarene for å validere prisregelen"

#. Description of the 'Include in Charts' (Check) field in DocType 'Financial
#. Report Row'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/financial_report_row/financial_report_row.json:131
msgid "If enabled, this row's values will be displayed on financial charts"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil verdiene i denne raden vises i finansielle diagrammer"

#. Description of the 'Confirm before resetting posting date' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:587
msgid "If enabled, user will be alerted before resetting posting date to current date in relevant transactions"
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, vil brukeren få en varsling før posteringsdato tilbakestilles til dagens dato i relevante transaksjoner"

#. Description of the 'Disable Serial No and Batch selector' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:243
msgid "If enabled, users must enter Serial No. / Batch data manually instead of using the selector dialog."
msgstr "Hvis aktivert, må brukere legge inn serienummer- / partidata manuelt i stedet for å bruke dialogboksen for valg."

#. Description of the 'Variant Of' (Link) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json:168
msgid "If item is a variant of another item then description, image, pricing, taxes etc will be set from the template unless explicitly specified"
msgstr "Hvis artikkelen er en variant av en annen artikkel, vil beskrivelse, bilde, prissetting, skatter osv. bli hentet fra malen med mindre det er angitt eksplisitt"

#. Description of the 'Get Items for Purchase / Transfer' (Button) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:407
msgid "If items in stock, proceed with Material Transfer or Purchase."
msgstr "Hvis artikler er på lager, fortsett med materialoverføring eller innkjøp."

#. Description of the 'Role allowed to create/edit back-dated transactions'
#. (Link) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:226
msgid "If mentioned, the system will allow only the users with this Role to create or modify any stock transaction earlier than the latest stock transaction for a specific item and warehouse. If set as blank, it allows all users to create/edit back-dated transactions."
msgstr "Hvis oppgitt, vil systemet kun tillate brukere med denne rollen å opprette eller endre lagertransaksjoner som er tidligere enn den siste lagertransaksjonen for en bestemt artikkel og et bestemt lager. Hvis feltet er tomt, tillater systemet alle brukere å opprette/redigere bakdaterte transaksjoner."

#. Description of the 'To Package No.' (Int) field in DocType 'Packing Slip'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/packing_slip/packing_slip.json:90
msgid "If more than one package of the same type (for print)"
msgstr "Hvis mer enn én pakke av samme type (for utskrift)"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:103
msgid "If multiple Pricing Rules continue to prevail, users are asked to set Priority manually to resolve conflict."
msgstr "Hvis flere prisregler fortsatt gjelder, blir brukere bedt om å angi prioritet manuelt for å løse konflikten."

#. Description of the 'Use prices from Default Price List as fallback' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:301
msgid "If no Item Price is found for an item in the Price List set in the transaction, prices from the Default Price List will be fetched."
msgstr "Hvis det ikke finnes noen Artikkelpris for en artikkel i Prislisten som er angitt i transaksjonen, hentes priser fra Standard prisliste."

#. Description of the 'Automatically add taxes from Taxes and Charges Template'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:611
msgid "If no taxes are set, and Taxes and Charges Template is selected, the system will automatically apply the taxes from the chosen template."
msgstr "Hvis ingen skatter er angitt, og Mal for skatter og avgifter er valgt, vil systemet automatisk bruke skattene fra den valgte malen."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2571
msgid "If not, you can Cancel / Submit this entry"
msgstr "Hvis ikke, kan du avbryte / registrere denne oppføringen"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:214
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Customer Name field."
msgstr "Hvis part ikke finnes, opprett den ved å bruke feltet Kundenavn."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:215
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Supplier Name field."
msgstr "Hvis part ikke finnes, opprett den ved å bruke feltet Leverandørnavn."

#. Description of the 'Free Item Rate' (Currency) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json:483
msgid "If rate is zero then item will be treated as \"Free Item\""
msgstr "Hvis prisen er null, behandles varen som \"Gratis vare\"."

#: banking/src/components/features/BankReconciliation/Rules/RuleForm.tsx:259
msgid "If rule matches, then:"
msgstr "Hvis regelen stemmer, så:"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:51
msgid "If selected Pricing Rule is made for 'Rate', it will overwrite Price List. Pricing Rule rate is the final rate, so no further discount should be applied. Hence, in transactions like Sales Order, Purchase Order etc, it will be fetched in 'Rate' field, rather than 'Price List Rate' field."
msgstr "Hvis valgt prisregel er laget for 'Pris', vil den overskrive prislisten. Prisregelens pris er den endelige prisen, så ingen ytterligere rabatt skal brukes. Derfor vil den i transaksjoner som Salgsordre, Innkjøpsordre osv. hentes inn i feltet 'Pris', i stedet for feltet 'Prislistepris'."

#. Description of the 'Default Accounts' (Table) field in DocType 'Customer'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/customer/customer.json:384
msgid "If set, accounting entries for this customer will post to these accounts instead of the company default."
msgstr "Hvis angitt, vil regnskapsposteringer for denne kunden bli bokført på disse kontoene i stedet for selskapets standard."

#. Description of the 'Fixed Outgoing Email Account' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json:261
msgid "If set, the system does not use the user's Email or the standard outgoing Email account for sending request for quotations."
msgstr "Hvis angitt, bruker ikke systemet brukerens E-post eller standard utgående E-postkonto til å sende tilbudsforespørsler."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1331
msgid "If the BOM results in Scrap material, the Scrap Warehouse needs to be selected."
msgstr "Hvis BOM gir skrapmateriale, må skraplageret velges."

#. Description of the 'Frozen' (Select) field in DocType 'Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/account/account.json:147
msgid "If the account is frozen, entries are allowed to restricted users."
msgstr "Hvis kontoen er sperret, tillates oppføringer for brukere med begrensninger."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2565
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If the item is transacting as a Zero Valuation Rate item in this entry, please enable 'Allow Zero Valuation Rate' in the {0} Item table."
msgstr "Hvis varen behandles som en vare med null verdsettelsessats i denne oppføringen, aktiver «Tillat null verdsettelsessats» i artikkeltabellen i {0}."

#. Description of the 'Projected On Hand' (Float) field in DocType 'Material
#. Request Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/material_request_item/material_request_item.json:518
msgid "If the reorder check is set at the Group warehouse level, the available quantity becomes the sum of the projected quantities of all its child warehouses."
msgstr "Hvis etterbestillingskontrollen er satt på Gruppelager-nivå, blir tilgjengelig antall summen av de prognostiserte mengdene i alle underordnede lagre."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1350
msgid "If the selected BOM has Operations mentioned in it, the system will fetch all Operations from BOM, these values can be changed."
msgstr "Hvis den valgte stykklisten har operasjoner nevnt i seg, vil systemet hente alle operasjoner fra stykklisten; disse verdiene kan endres."

#. Description of the 'Catch All' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Medium'
#: erpnext/communication/doctype/communication_medium/communication_medium.json:28
msgid "If there is no assigned timeslot, then communication will be handled by this group"
msgstr "Hvis det ikke finnes noen tildelt tidsluke, vil kommunikasjonen håndteres av denne gruppen"

#: erpnext/edi/doctype/code_list/code_list_import.js:24
msgid "If there is no title column, use the code column for the title."
msgstr "Hvis det ikke finnes en tittelkolonne, bruk kodekolonnen som tittel."

#. Description of the 'Allocate Payment Based On Payment Terms' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Payment Terms Template'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_terms_template/payment_terms_template.json:33
msgid "If this checkbox is checked, paid amount will be splitted and allocated as per the amounts in payment schedule against each payment term"
msgstr "Hvis denne avkrysningsboksen er avkrysset, vil betalt beløp deles opp og fordeles etter beløpene i betalingsplanen for hver betalingsbetingelse"

#. Description of the 'Follow Calendar Months' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Subscription'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/subscription/subscription.json:200
msgid "If this is checked subsequent new invoices will be created on calendar  month and quarter start dates irrespective of current invoice start date"
msgstr "Hvis dette er avkrysset, vil påfølgende nye fakturaer bli opprettet på kalendermåneds- og kvartalsstartdatoer, uavhengig av startdatoen for gjeldende faktura"

#. Description of the 'Submit Journal entries' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:256
msgid "If this is unchecked Journal Entries will be saved in a Draft state and will have to be submitted manually"
msgstr "Hvis dette ikke er avmerket, lagres journalposteringer i utkast-tilstand og må sendes inn manuelt"

#. Description of the 'Book deferred entries via Journal Entry' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:248
msgid "If this is unchecked, direct GL entries will be created to book deferred revenue or expense"
msgstr "Hvis dette ikke er avkrysset, vil direkte hovedboksposteringer opprettes for å bokføre utsatt inntekt eller kostnad"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_entry/payment_entry.py:787
msgid "If this is undesirable please cancel the corresponding Payment Entry."
msgstr "Hvis dette er uønsket, avbryt den tilsvarende Betalingsposteringen."

#. Description of the 'Has Variants' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json:563
msgid "If this item has variants, then it cannot be selected in sales orders etc."
msgstr "Hvis denne artikkelen har varianter, kan den ikke velges i salgsordrer osv."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:76
msgid "If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating a Purchase Invoice or Receipt without creating a Purchase Order first. This configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the 'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Order' checkbox in the Supplier master."
msgstr "Hvis dette alternativet er konfigurert til 'Ja', vil ERPNext hindre deg i å opprette en Innkjøpsfaktura eller Mottak uten å opprette en Innkjøpsordre først. Denne konfigurasjonen kan overstyres for en bestemt leverandør ved å aktivere avkrysningsboksen 'Tillat opprettelse av innkjøpsfaktura uten innkjøpsordre' i leverandørens grunndata."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:83
msgid "If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating a Purchase Invoice without creating a Purchase Receipt first. This configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the 'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Receipt' checkbox in the Supplier master."
msgstr "Hvis dette alternativet er satt til 'Ja', vil ERPNext hindre deg i å opprette en Innkjøpsfaktura uten først å opprette en Varemottak. Denne konfigurasjonen kan overstyres for en bestemt leverandør ved å aktivere avkrysningsboksen 'Tillat opprettelse av innkjøpsfaktura uten varemottak' i leverandørens grunndata."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:10
msgid "If ticked, multiple materials can be used for a single Work Order. This is useful if one or more time consuming products are being manufactured."
msgstr "Hvis avmerket, kan flere materialer brukes for én arbeidsordre. Dette er nyttig hvis ett eller flere tidkrevende produkter produseres."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:24
msgid "If ticked, the BOM cost will be automatically updated based on Valuation Rate / Price List Rate / last purchase rate of raw materials."
msgstr "Hvis avkrysset, oppdateres kostnaden for stykklisten (BOM) automatisk basert på verdsettelsessats / prislistepris / siste innkjøpspris for råvarer."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:82
msgid "If two or more Pricing Rules are found based on the above conditions, Priority is applied. Priority is a number between 0 to 20 while default value is zero (blank). Higher number means it will take precedence if there are multiple Pricing Rules with same conditions."
msgstr "Hvis to eller flere Prisregler finnes basert på betingelsene ovenfor, brukes Prioritet. Prioritet er et tall mellom 0 og 20, mens standardverdien er null (tom). Et høyere tall betyr at den får forrang hvis det finnes flere Prisregler med samme betingelser."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/loyalty_program/loyalty_program.js:31
msgid "If unlimited expiry for the Loyalty Points, keep the Expiry Duration empty or 0."
msgstr "Hvis Lojalitetspoeng skal ha ubegrenset utløp, la feltet for utløpsvarighet stå tomt eller sett det til 0."

#. Description of the 'Is Rejected Warehouse' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Warehouse'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json:266
msgid "If yes, then this warehouse will be used to store rejected materials"
msgstr "Hvis ja, vil dette lageret brukes til å lagre avviste materialer"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.js:1476
msgid "If you are maintaining stock of this Item in your Inventory, ERPNext will make a stock ledger entry for each transaction of this item."
msgstr "Hvis du lagerfører denne Artikkelen i ditt Lager, vil ERPNext opprette en lagerpostering for hver transaksjon med denne artikkelen."

#. Description of the 'Unreconciled Entries' (Section Break) field in DocType
#. 'Payment Reconciliation'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_reconciliation/payment_reconciliation.json:92
msgid "If you need to reconcile particular transactions against each other, then please select accordingly. If not, all the transactions will be allocated in FIFO order."
msgstr "Hvis du må avstemme bestemte transaksjoner mot hverandre, velg dem deretter. Hvis ikke, blir alle transaksjonene fordelt i FIFO-rekkefølge."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.py:1256
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If you still want to proceed, please disable '{0}' checkbox."
msgstr "Hvis du likevel ønsker å fortsette, deaktiver avkrysningsboksen '{0}'."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.py:2297
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If you still want to proceed, please enable {0}."
msgstr "Hvis du likevel ønsker å fortsette, må du aktivere {0}."

#. Description of the 'Sequence ID' (Int) field in DocType 'BOM Operation'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/bom_operation/bom_operation.json:153
msgid "If you want to run operations in parallel, keep the same sequence ID for them."
msgstr "Hvis du vil kjøre operasjoner parallelt, bruk samme sekvens-ID for dem."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/utils.py:379
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If you {0} {1} quantities of the item {2}, the scheme {3} will be applied on the item."
msgstr "Hvis du {0} {1} enheter av artikkelen {2}, vil ordningen {3} bli brukt på artikkelen."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/utils.py:383
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If you {0} {1} worth item {2}, the scheme {3} will be applied on the item."
msgstr "Hvis du {0} artikkel {2} for {1}, vil ordningen {3} bli brukt på artikkelen."

